  "id": "cooperative-play",
  "term": "cooperative play",
  "definition": "Cooperative play is behavior in a team setting that emphasizes helping teammates and working toward shared group goals rather than focusing only on one’s own individual performance. In this context, it contrasts with selfish play, where personal success is prioritized over actions that benefit the team.",
